{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26662","headline":"寄华州李中丞 · 姚合","name":"寄华州李中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"毛女峰前郡，烟霞气转清。\n庭分灵掌影，窗度瀑泉声。\n藓迳人稀到，松斋药自生。\n常飡亦芝术，闲客是公卿。\n看水逢仙鹤，登楼见帝城。\n养生非酒病，难隐是诗名。\n省署尝连步，江臯欲独耕。\n偶题无六义，聊以达微诚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}